sequenceDiagram
    participant T as TriggerEvaluator
    participant LE as LinkEngine
    participant C as DSPatch::Circuit
    participant S as Source VPN
    participant D as Downstream Extender

    Note over T,D: VPN Connected
    T->>LE: activate_link("cloud_mavlink")
    LE->>LE: resolve port indices
    LE->>C: ConnectOutToIn(vpn, 0, ext, 0)
    C-->>LE: OK
    LE->>LE: active = true

    Note over T,D: Circuit::Tick() loop
    C->>S: Process_()
    S->>S: emit binding to tunnel[0]
    C->>D: Process_()
    D->>D: GetValue TransportBinding
    D->>D: apply_binding() start_extender()

    Note over T,D: VPN Disconnected
    T->>LE: deactivate_link("cloud_mavlink")
    LE->>D: DisconnectInput(0)
    LE->>LE: active = false
